<title>USA: PictureTel sees Q4 revs near $140 mln.</title>
<headline>PictureTel sees Q4 revs near $140 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>PictureTel Corp expects to report record fourth quarter revenues of close to $140 million, Les Strauss, chief financial officer, said on Monday Monday.</p>
<p>In a statement, Strauss also said he was confident the company's fourth quarter earnings per share will meet analysts' expectations.</p>
<p>The previous record for revenues, $121.3 million, came in the 1996 third quarter.</p>
<p>The company said it would report results for the fourth quarter on February 12.</p>
</text>
